# hero-click-fit-1024x640 (h11-hero): the hero's screen centre in the shrunk
# page (1024 x 640, fit 0.71 at density 2), read from page.json's
# welcome-fit-1024x640 hero_plane box (369.999, 135.399, 596.400, 369.200 CSS
# px): its centre is (668, 320). The click navigates to #function-viewer with
# an empty query, as the click at fit 1 does.
route welcome
size 1024 640
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
reduced-motion on
wait 2000
click 668 320
wait 2000
move 511 34
wait 300
shot hero-click-fit-1024x640
